		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour à tous,</p><p>Je tourne en pg 9.1 cluster</p><p>j&#039;ai l&#039;erreur suivante:</p><p>Error could not extend file &quot;pg_tblspc/16384/PG_9.1_201105231/16387/16453&quot;: Aucun espace disponible sur le périphérique<br />HINT:&#160; Check free disk space.</p><p>Le problème, c&#039;est que j&#039;ai de la place sur les disques:</p><p>postgres@bdd-102:/data/bdd/backup$ df -h<br />Sys. de fichiers Taille Utilisé Dispo Uti% Monté sur<br />/dev/sda5&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;28G&#160; &#160; 1,4G&#160; &#160;25G&#160; &#160;6% /<br />udev&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;3,9G&#160; &#160; 4,0K&#160; 3,9G&#160; &#160;1% /dev<br />tmpfs&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 1,6G&#160; &#160; 256K&#160; 1,6G&#160; &#160;1% /run<br />none&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;5,0M&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;0&#160; 5,0M&#160; &#160;0% /run/lock<br />none&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;3,9G&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;0&#160; 3,9G&#160; &#160;0% /run/shm<br />/dev/sda7&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;19G&#160; &#160; 270M&#160; &#160;18G&#160; &#160;2% /tmp<br />/dev/sda1&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 184M&#160; &#160; &#160;32M&#160; 143M&#160; 19% /boot<br />/dev/sda9&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;93G&#160; &#160; 200M&#160; &#160;88G&#160; &#160;1% /data<br />/dev/sda6&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;19G&#160; &#160; 172M&#160; &#160;18G&#160; &#160;1% /home<br />/dev/sda8&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;37G&#160; &#160; 1,3G&#160; &#160;34G&#160; &#160;4% /var</p><p>Et la base est particulièrement petite (le dump fais 16k ...)</p><p>postgres=# SELECT * FROM pgstattuple(&#039;pg_catalog.pg_proc&#039;);<br /> table_len | tuple_count | tuple_len | tuple_percent | dead_tuple_count | dead_tuple_len | dead_tuple_percent | free_space | free_percent <br />-----------+-------------+-----------+---------------+------------------+----------------+--------------------+------------+--------------<br />&#160; &#160; 466944 |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 2346 |&#160; &#160; 440640 |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;94.37 |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 0 |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 0 |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 0 |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;7280 |&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;1.56</p><br /><p>Apparement, il ne me reste que 1,56% de libre.<br />J&#039;ai l&#039;impression de manquer quelque chose ...</p><p>Help!</p><p>Merci.</p>]]></content>
